/* ── D433 THE SIMPLE MENU (owner, 2026-10-22) ─────────────────────────
   Default: Device and the Essentials as big picture doors sharing the
   screen, this config's status strip under them, one small Advanced button
   at the foot. #edmenu.edsimple is that; without it, the full list. The
   change is animated on layout values (CSS transitions reverse from where
   they are, so a second tap mid-way turns it straight round) with the
   app's settle curve, no bounce: a menu re-arranging is not a thrown
   object. Reduced motion: a short cross-fade only. */
html body #edmenu > .item,
html body #edmenu > .edgrp,
html body #edmenu > .edstat {
  transition: max-height .44s var(--ease-settle, cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)),
